<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN OPEN THIRD ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN OPEN THIRD ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scores from the third round</p>
<p>of the South African Open at the par 72 Glendower course on</p>
<p>Saturday (South African unless stated):</p>
<p>201 Vijay Singh (Fiji) 69 66 66</p>
<p>203 Nick Price (Zimbabwe) 72 66 65</p>
<p>205 Ernie Els 66 72 67</p>
<p>206 Mark McNulty (Zimbabwe) 69 69 68</p>
<p>208 David Gilford (England) 69 66 73, Fulton Allem 66 71</p>
<p>71</p>
<p>209 Eamonn Darcy (Ireland) 67 69 73, Adam Hunter (Scotland) 71</p>
<p>68 70</p>
<p>210 Hennie Otto (amateur) 74 68 68, Ian Woosnam (Wales)</p>
<p>66 75 69, Jean van de Velde (France) 68 69 73,</p>
<p>Thomas Bjorn (Denmark) 66 69 75, Wayne Bradley 65</p>
<p>70 75</p>
<p>211 Retief Goosen 72 67 72 212 Anders Forsbrand (Sweden)</p>
<p>70 72 70, Andrew McLardy 72 71 69, Sven Struver</p>
<p>(Germany) 70 71 71, Bobby Lincoln 71 69 72, Gary</p>
<p>Evans (England) 68 72 72, Wayne Westner 69 70 73.</p>
